#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:5 8e82ef830c4f438c9ee23ef7e3a36e54
msgid "VTOL QUICKTUNE"
msgstr "VTOL QUICKTUNE（快速调参）"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:9 e3137f9fb59d402c8421ef0cfb8720bf
msgid ""
"ArduPlane provides a quick means of obtaining a good tune for Quadplanes "
"in VTOL modes. The process slowly increases the relevant gains until it "
"detects an oscillation.  It then reduces the gains by 60% and moves onto "
"the next gain. Once all the gains have been tuned the tune completes and "
"the user can decide to save or discard the new gains."
msgstr ""
"ArduPlane 提供了一种快速获得 QuadPlane 在 VTOL "
"模式下良好调参结果的方法。该过程缓慢增大相关增益直到检测到振荡，然后将增益降低 60% "
"并进入下一个增益的调参。待所有增益调参完成后，用户可以选择保存或放弃新的增益值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:11 91c52c856d8c4e07a28aa1f15aa16cad
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"be sure that you have prepared the vehicle for tuning by setting up "
"parameters discussed here: :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` Steps 1 "
"to 11 and then use this mechanism in Step 12. Also to assure the best "
"tune, setup the noise notch filtering, see :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`. You may run QUICKTUNE without this step to obtain initial "
"fine tune, see :ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning` if the vehicle can't do an "
"initial hover stably. Then setup the filters and retune for best results."
msgstr ""
"请确保已按照此处讨论的参数为飞机调参做好准备：:ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` 步骤 1 至 "
"11，然后在步骤 12 使用此机制。此外，为保证最佳调参效果，请设置噪声陷波滤波器，详见 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`。若飞机无法稳定初次悬停，可先运行 QUICKTUNE 以获得初步微调，参见 "
":ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning`。之后设置滤波器并重新调参以获得最佳结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:13 04b3f685553745b39d6bd526fc5ab891
msgid ""
"The script attempts to automatically tune the P/I and D gain of each axis"
" enabled for tuning when an two or three position RC switch, whose "
"``RCx_OPTION`` is \"181\", is moved to the \"tune\" position. It will, by"
" default, also adjust some PID loop filter values based on the "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` setting."
msgstr ""
"当 ``RCx_OPTION`` 为 「181」 的二档或三档 RC 开关移到「调参」位置时，该脚本会尝试自动调参每个启用调参轴的 P/I 和 D"
" 增益。默认情况下，还会根据 :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` 设置调整一些 PID 环滤波器数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:15 2b890b1e022f43d0be0029c07ad41353
msgid ""
"The advantage over QAUTOTUNE is that QUICKTUNE is safer because the "
"vehicle does not need to move or twitch and QAUTOTUNE can occasionally "
"result in instablity. Therefore QAUTOTUNE is not longer recommended for "
"use, except by experts."
msgstr ""
"相比 QAUTOTUNE，QUICKTUNE 的优势在于更安全，因为飞机无需移动或抖动，而 QAUTOTUNE "
"偶尔会导致不稳定。因此除专家外，不再推荐使用 QAUTOTUNE。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:17 4ef90cd1d6194f4ca665eb0b1e3b7896
msgid ""
"The disadvantage is that QUICKTUNE cannot find the vehicle's maximum "
"rotational accelerations or tune the attitude angle outer loops from "
"their default or pre-tune adjusted (:ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process`)"
" values. However, tuning only the inner rate loops usually will yield a "
"stable, safe flying vehicle."
msgstr ""
"缺点是 QUICKTUNE 无法找到飞机的最大旋转加速度，也无法从默认值或预调整值（:ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-"
"process`）中调整姿态角外环。但仅调参内部速率环通常也能获得稳定、安全的飞行效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:20 99e01e2f7964490398131d6c0fe2bdbd
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:21 70c278ade551492480b71fdd5f6dca04
msgid "Set :ref:`QWIK_ENABLE<QWIK_ENABLE>` = \"1\" to enable QUICKTUNE."
msgstr "将 :ref:`QWIK_ENABLE<QWIK_ENABLE>` 设为 「1」 以启用 QUICKTUNE。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:22 f46d06a82ab14e4ebb06921cbbc1c352
msgid "Set :ref:`QWIK_AXES<QWIK_AXES>` to which axes (Roll/Pitch/Yaw)."
msgstr "将 :ref:`QWIK_AXES<QWIK_AXES>` 设为需要调参的轴（横滚/俯仰/偏航）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:25 23a135e828d14ae79d9acb51c96f0531
msgid "Activation RC Switch"
msgstr "激活 RC 开关"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:26 a690759ae31e4a0ebe75de32bcb9c250
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Set up a two or three position RC switch with ``RCx_OPTION`` = \"181\". "
"If it is a two position switch set :ref:`QWIK_OPTIONS<QWIK_OPTIONS>` bit "
"0 to \"1\", and you probably want to set the "
":ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` parameter to autosave the tune once"
" completed."
msgstr ""
"设置一个 `RCx_OPTION`` = 「181」 的二档或三档 RC 开关。若为二档开关，将 "
":ref:`QWIK_OPTIONS<QWIK_OPTIONS>` 位 0 设为 「1」，并建议设置 "
":ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` 参数以在调参完成后自动保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:28 ad79b23363d7475ea57b757d283f32c1
msgid ""
"With a three position switch, moving the switch to \"high\" (>1800us) is "
"the \"save\" position which will save the current tune parameters, even "
"if the tune is not completed yet. Moving the switch to the middle "
"position activates the tuning process (\"tune\"). Moving the switch to "
"the \"low\" position (<1200us), stops the tuning and reverts the "
"parameters to their values before tuning began."
msgstr "使用三档开关时，拨到「高」（>1800us）为「保存」位置，将保存当前调参参数（即使调参尚未完成）。拨到中间位置激活调参过程（「调参」）。拨到「低」位置（<1200us）停止调参并将参数恢复到调参开始前的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:30 58ea2ecf109e438cbeacc48600977ca1
msgid ""
"RC AUX switches only operate on transitions of the switch. Their position"
" at boot does nothing, so if a switch is \"high\" at boot, in order to "
"get the \"high\" function, it must be moved to another position and then "
"back \"high\"."
msgstr "RC AUX 开关仅在开关状态转换时触发。开机时的位置无效，因此若开关在开机时处于「高」位，需先拨到其他位置再拨回「高」才能触发「高」功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:32 52fee9d2b0524b5ebd578c306fbbd548
msgid ""
"With a two position switch, \"high\" is the \"tune\" position, and "
"\"low\" stops/reverts tuning. In order to save parameters, you must have "
"set the :ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` parameter or use a GCS AUX "
"switch facility."
msgstr ""
"使用二档开关时，「高」为「调参」位置，「低」停止/恢复调参。要保存参数，必须已设置 "
":ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` 参数，或使用地面站 AUX 开关功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:35 c7ac3208b0cb46dfbba8c790a4aacda1
msgid "Tuning Flight"
msgstr "调参飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:36 d70a39e80d04436595e0ae5202fef64d
msgid "Wait for a calm day and go to an open area with good GPS reception"
msgstr "选择平静的天气，前往有良好 GPS 信号的开阔区域"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:37 424375c233794b05ad05a60bd43022a2
msgid ""
"Use an OSD, TX OSD (using :ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>`), or GCS. "
"This is where output from the tune will appear"
msgstr "使用 OSD、TX OSD（使用 :ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>`）或地面站。调参输出将显示在这里"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:38 424e3dd9f7c1434eb0dad6d72dbc472d
msgid ""
"Move the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's "
"\"Low\" button"
msgstr "将 RC 开关拨到低位，或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Low」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:39 28c883e797e84a47a0b83fbb70aa1ac3
msgid "Arm and takeoff in QLOITER mode and climb to a height of about 3m"
msgstr "在 QLOITER 模式下解锁并起飞，爬升至约 3m 高度"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:40 d5ee41aff8a34a338f482fc2b33da8eb
msgid ""
"Begin the tune by moving the RC switch to the \"tune\" position OR push "
"MP's Aux Function's \"Mid\" button"
msgstr "将 RC 开关拨到「调参」位置，或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Mid」按钮，开始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:41 c765b83493014d8197c4818cc5b31414
msgid "Monitor the progress of the tune using the GCS's Messages tab"
msgstr "通过地面站的消息标签页监控调参进度"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:42 6a07b771dc254398becd668244116c39
msgid ""
"If necessary reposition the vehicle using the RC transmitter.  This will "
"temporarily pause tuning.  Tuning will resume a few seconds after the RC "
"sticks are returned to their center position"
msgstr "如有必要，使用 RC 遥控器重新定位飞机。这将暂时暂停调参。待 RC 摇杆回到中立位置几秒钟后，调参将恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:43 4e6497cb57434568b554687f9bb985f9
msgid ""
"If the vehicle begins oscillating violently you can cancel the tune by "
"moving the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's "
"\"Low\" button. If the vehicle rocks or pitches more than "
":ref:`QWIK_ANGLE_MAX<QWIK_ANGLE_MAX>` the tune will automatically abort."
msgstr ""
"若飞机开始剧烈振荡，可将 RC 开关拨到低位或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Low」按钮取消调参。若飞机横滚或俯仰超过 "
":ref:`QWIK_ANGLE_MAX<QWIK_ANGLE_MAX>`，调参将自动中止。"

#: ../../source/docs/quicktune.rst:44 519b61539ba840f699c26438d77d7bf9
msgid ""
"Once the tune has completed accept the new gains by moving the RC aux "
"switch to the \"save\" position, wait for the "
":ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` timeout, OR push MP's Aux "
"Function's \"High\" button"
msgstr ""
"调参完成后，将 RC 辅助开关拨到「保存」位置，等待 :ref:`QWIK_AUTO_SAVE<QWIK_AUTO_SAVE>` 超时，或按下 "
"Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「High」按钮，接受新的增益值"

